   952	    ``cond_method``, ``frame_avg_angles`` (the frame-average angles used by the
   953	    :data:`FRAME_AVERAGED_COND_METHODS`; ``None`` for vanilla), ``cond_autocast``, and the ORBIT
   954	    EXECUTION provenance (exp_11): which implementation produced the
   955	    conditioning (``batched`` vs the legacy per-angle ``loop``), its per-forward
   956	    sample cap, and the source SHA. Rows produced by different orbit executions
   957	    are not interchangeable — the batched path changes the train-mode
   958	    augmentation schedule and regroups the evaluation tail batch — so this is
   959	    what makes "legacy-loop" a checkable label rather than a footnote.
   960	
